@startuml 用户登录并播放歌曲-时序图
' ============================================================
' 场景：用户从登录到播放一首歌的完整时序
' 涉及：React前端 → Axios客户端 → FastAPI后端 → 数据库
' ============================================================

title myMusic 系统时序图 —— 用户登录并播放歌曲

actor 用户 as User
participant "React\n(LoginPage)" as LoginPage
participant "React\n(HomePage)" as HomePage
participant "Axios\nClient" as Axios
participant "FastAPI\n/auth" as AuthAPI
participant "FastAPI\n/songs" as SongAPI
participant "Auth\nMiddleware" as AuthMW
database "MySQL\nDatabase" as DB

== 1. 用户登录 ==

User -> LoginPage : 输入用户名/密码，点击登录
activate LoginPage

LoginPage -> LoginPage : 前端校验\n(用户名/密码非空)

LoginPage -> Axios : POST /auth/login\n{user_name, password}
activate Axios

Axios -> AuthAPI : HTTP POST /api/v1/auth/login
activate AuthAPI

AuthAPI -> DB : SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_name = ?
activate DB
DB --> AuthAPI : user 记录 / null
deactivate DB

alt 用户不存在或密码错误
    AuthAPI --> Axios : 401 Unauthorized
    Axios --> LoginPage : error
    LoginPage -> LoginPage : 显示错误提示
else 验证成功
    AuthAPI -> AuthAPI : bcrypt.verify_password()
    AuthAPI -> AuthAPI : jwt.encode({sub:user_id, exp})
    AuthAPI --> Axios : 200 {token, user_id, user_name, avatar_url}
    deactivate AuthAPI

    Axios --> LoginPage : result.data
    deactivate Axios

    LoginPage -> LoginPage : 根据"自动登录"选择\nlocalStorage 或 sessionStorage\n存储 token + user
    LoginPage -> LoginPage : navigate("/") 跳转首页
    deactivate LoginPage
end

== 2. 路由守卫校验 ==

HomePage -> HomePage : useAuth() 检查 token
note right of HomePage
  useEffect 读取 localStorage/sessionStorage
  有 token → 渲染首页
  无 token → navigate("/login")
end note

== 3. 浏览歌曲列表 ==

User -> HomePage : 进入首页，查看热门歌曲
activate HomePage

HomePage -> Axios : GET /songs?page=1&page_size=20
activate Axios
Axios -> Axios : 拦截器自动附加\nAuthorization: Bearer <token>

Axios -> SongAPI : GET /api/v1/songs?page=1&page_size=20
activate SongAPI

SongAPI -> DB : SELECT * FROM songs\nWHERE current_status=1\nORDER BY create_time DESC\nLIMIT 20 OFFSET 0
activate DB
DB --> SongAPI : 歌曲列表 + total
deactivate DB

SongAPI --> Axios : 200 {items:[...], total, page}
deactivate SongAPI
Axios --> HomePage : data
deactivate Axios

HomePage -> HomePage : 渲染歌曲列表

== 4. 播放歌曲 ==

User -> HomePage : 点击播放某首歌
HomePage -> Axios : POST /songs/{song_id}/play\n{is_completed:true, playlist_duration:0}
activate Axios
Axios -> Axios : 附加 Bearer token

Axios -> AuthMW : 请求到达 /songs/{id}/play
activate AuthMW

AuthMW -> AuthMW : decode_access_token()\n解析 JWT 获取 user_id

AuthMW -> DB : SELECT * FROM users\nWHERE user_id = ?
activate DB
DB --> AuthMW : user 对象
deactivate DB

alt token 无效或用户不存在
    AuthMW --> Axios : 401 → 触发响应拦截器
    Axios -> Axios : 清除 token，跳转 /login
else 认证通过
    AuthMW -> SongAPI : current_user = Users 实例
    deactivate AuthMW
    activate SongAPI

    SongAPI -> DB : SELECT * FROM songs\nWHERE song_id = ?
    activate DB
    DB --> SongAPI : song 记录
    deactivate DB

    alt 歌曲不存在
        SongAPI --> Axios : 404 Song not found
    else 歌曲存在
        SongAPI -> SongAPI : song.play_count += 1
        SongAPI -> DB : INSERT INTO play_history\n(user_id, song_id, artist_id,\n is_completed, playlist_duration)
        activate DB
        DB --> SongAPI : OK
        deactivate DB

        SongAPI --> Axios : 200 {play_count: N}
        deactivate SongAPI
        Axios --> HomePage : data
        deactivate Axios

        HomePage -> HomePage : 更新播放计数显示\n开始播放音频 (Howler.js)
    end
end

deactivate HomePage

@enduml
